; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; ADAPTED FOR THE INFERNIS ENGINE. The values are the author's; two things had to change:
;
; 1. Section headers. The author writes an override as "![section]" ( Anomaly DLTX ). The
;    Infernis config loader ( xrCore\Xr_ini.cpp, CInifile::Load ) opens a section only on a line
;    that starts with "[" and expects the "!" inside the brackets: "[!section]". With the
;    author's spelling the file was read and every line of it was dropped.
;
; 2. Child sections. In Anomaly an override is applied before inheritance is resolved, so every
;    anomaly that inherits from a section below receives these keys as well. The Infernis loader
;    copies the parent's keys into the child while it parses the child and reads this file
;    afterwards, so the children are listed one by one in the second half of this file with
;    exactly the keys Anomaly resolves for them.
;
; Generated and checked by _ssfx_work\zone_children.py ( --write / --check ).
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

